 "description": "Get a specific financial metric for a company across all filings. Use this to track revenue, net income, or any XBRL tag over time. Example: get_company_concept(cik: \"320193\", taxonomy: \"us-gaap\", tag: \"Revenue\").",
 "inputSchema": {
